# Backend settings for environments that use environment variables (containers, CI).
# For local `dotnet run`, prefer user-secrets (see README "Configuration").
# Copy to backend/.env (git-ignored) and replace placeholders. Never commit real values.
# Nested settings use a double underscore: Database:ConnectionString -> Database__ConnectionString.
Database__ConnectionString=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=choggames;Username=choggames;Password=change-me-local-only
